{"parentUuid":"af312a14-a573-41b7-9877-cfca2ac8dac9","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"cc4dbf1e-79de-4dba-bef6-7dc85562f73f","agentId":"a13f3ca3e19263a03","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FfL2dEJKHFTW6CJHagdT7T","type":"tool_result","content":"On branch main\nChanges not staged for commit:\n  (use \"git add <file>...\" to update what will be committed)\n  (use \"git restore <file>...\" to discard changes in working directory)\n\tmodified:   cuore/api/experience.py\n\tmodified:   cuore/live/experience_inputs.py\n\tmodified:   cuore/services/experience_bridge.py\n\tmodified:   cuore/web/static/cuore.css\n\tmodified:   cuore/web/static/experience.js\n\tmodified:   cuore/web/templates/_mes_handoff.html\n\tmodified:   cuore/web/templates/scanlog.html\n\tmodified:   docs/research/MECHANIC_REVIEW_7_2026-10-14.md\n\nUntracked files:\n  (use \"git add <file>...\" to include in what will be committed)\n\tkoch-mcp/\n\nno changes added to commit (use \"git add\" and/or \"git commit -a\")\n---\n431f539 Systems page bands gated by VIN; recommended EVAP test order\n4a5d567 Screenshots: Bench dark, pre-pass vs after the comment-typo fix\nc50f90d Fix CSS comment-closing typo that silently dropped the whole foundation :root block in real browsers\n05f7ae6 Known-good bands gated by platform/marque; honest \"no band on file\" for other models\ne8c8ff3 Sibling platforms: Grecale/Levante/Purosangue bus topology researched and recorded with sources\n---remote---\nforge\thttps://southbrookcabinetry.space/git/john/alfa-diagnostics.git (fetch)\nforge\thttps://southbrookcabinetry.space/git/john/alfa-diagnostics.git (push)\ngithub\thttps://github.com/dangelojohn/CUORE.git (fetch)\ngithub\thttps://github.com/dangelojohn/CUORE.git (push)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"34bd5858-3c32-40d7-af95-6355c104a2cd","timestamp":"2026-10-14T17:15:15.360Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"On branch main\nChanges not staged for commit:\n  (use \"git add <file>...\" to update what