{"parentUuid":"db942876-0e1a-4c80-88e8-e39fbbd1d79f","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a13f3ca3e19263a03","attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01CbSsEef9KzeBfxzYbTbdp1","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"cce14388-c4e3-45da-bc42-951130a46c75","timestamp":"2026-10-14T17:22:04.158Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"cce14388-c4e3-45da-bc42-951130a46c75","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a13f3ca3e19263a03","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cg2WrTa1YCXYm3HqfH1LD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01226TK3Ki5dPvRdeEuP7zyX","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nMobile: verified true-black under both OS themes after the :root fix\n\nNew check_mobile_theme.py drives headless Edge at 390x844 against a\nthrowaway server (own CUORE_STATE_DIR, seeded with a read-only copy of the\nreal 2026-10-13 observation lines) with BOTH emulated prefers-color-scheme\nvalues, across all six mobile routes (/m/{vin}, add/fuel/fill_up,\n/messages, /history, /print, /snap). data-theme=\"dark\" (m_base.html) pins\nthe mobile layer to cuore.css's bare :root block regardless of the OS\npreference -- exactly the block c50f90d's comment-typo fix restored -- so\nthis is the regression check for that fix on the one layer that always\nreads it.\n\n91/91 checks pass: body background is true black on every route under\nboth themes, no horizontal overflow at 390px, chip/label text >=12px,\nevery measured tap target >=48px, the opening reveal is present and\ndismissable on first tap, and body background/color-scheme are identical\ndark-pass vs light-pass (confirming the OS preference has no effect here).\nNo CSS defect found -- cuore.css's tokens now resolve correctly under\nboth themes on this layer, so no change was needed in m.css.\n\ncheck_owner_page.py (139 checks) and check_screens.py (28 checks) both\nstill pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\"\ngit status --short","description":"Commit the new mobile theme verification test"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":444,"cache_read_input_tokens":155261,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":444,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01226TK3Ki5dPvRdeEuP7zyX":{"command":"cd /c/Users/User/mcp-servers && git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nMobile: verified true-black under both OS themes after the :root fix\n\nNew check_mobile_theme.py drives headless Edge at 390x844 against a\nthrowaway server (own CUORE_STATE_DIR, seeded with a read-only copy of the\nreal 2026-10-13 observation lines) with BOTH emulated prefers-color-scheme\nvalues, across all six mobile routes (/m/{vin}, add/fuel/fill_up,\n/messages, /history, /print, /snap). data-theme=\"dark\" (m_base.html) pins\nthe mobile layer to cuore.css's bare :root block regardless of the OS\npreference -- exactly the block c50f90d's comment-typo fix restored -- so\nthis is the regression check for that fix on the one layer that always\nreads it.\n\n91/91 checks pass: body background is true black on every route under\nboth themes, no horizontal overflow at 390px, chip/label text >=12px,\nevery measured tap target >=48px, the opening reveal is present and\ndismissable on first tap, and body background/color-scheme are identical\ndark-pass vs light-pass (confirming the OS preference has no effect here).\nNo CSS defect found -- cuore.css's tokens now resolve correctly under\nboth themes on this layer, so no change was needed in m.css.\n\ncheck_owner_page.py (139 checks) and check_screens.py (28 checks) both\nstill pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\"\ngit status --short","description":"Commit the new mobile theme verification test"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01226TK3Ki5dPvRdeEuP7zyX":{"cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"343b9037-57b4-46b9-a5f2-91b78b183c9d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cg2WrTEfe95N7YxM4pJGJ","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"3dfafc60-b0c3-45d4-b33